      "reason": "OpenMRS serves GET /ws/rest/v1/session from a Spring controller (SessionController1_9), not a resource handler; SwaggerSpecificationCreator only documents resource handlers, so the generated spec never lists it.",
      "evidence": "https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-module-webservices.rest/blob/685eedf1b6eef1e6f250aab1bfcf502c37078be8/omod/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/v1_0/controller/openmrs1_9/SessionController1_9.java#L50-L87"
    },
    {
