      "pointer": "/person",
      "category": "vendor-spec-wrong",
      "reason": "Creating a patient accepts person as either an existing person's uuid or a full nested person object (PatientResource1_8.getPatient branches on String vs Map). The Swagger CREATE model emits the string form for the default representation and PersonCreate only for the full representation, so the spec says string.",
      "evidence": "https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-module-webservices.rest/blob/685eedf1b6eef1e6f250aab1bfcf502c37078be8/omod/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/v1_0/resource/openmrs1_8/PatientResource1_8.java#L173-L185 and #L256-L266"
    },
